          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_8.35.55_AM.jpg",
            "content": "<p>“This was my first order here and I am really impressed. I will not be buying my perfume anywhere else from now on. I had never found a fragrance dupe that smelled truly authentic and stayed consistently good before.” </p>",
            "author": "Sebastian Müller",
