          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>“All three fragrances I ordered smell really good and last a long time, too. They are really close to the originals. The only thing was delivery, which took a little longer. But honestly – I still placed another order straight away 😄 You just need a little patience.”</p>",
            "author": "Clara P.",
