      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_b44n9F": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are your perfumes so affordable?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We focus on the fragrance itself. No luxury bottles, special packaging, expensive shops or costly influencer deals — so you can smell luxurious without breaking your budget.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rCVDnP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it an Eau de Toilette or an Eau de Parfum?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, it is an Eau de Parfum – it contains between 19% and 21% fragrance oil, depending on the perfume. Eau de Toilette, for example, contains between 5% and 15%.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rNbx6p": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the perfume last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>How long the perfume lasts depends on the person and how it is applied. Sprayed on the skin, it lasts 8 to 12 hours or even longer thanks to our formula and 19–21% perfume oil concentration. The scent fades over time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_irweNa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is a fragrance dupe?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It is an Eau de Parfum with up to 19% fragrance oil, inspired by expensive luxury perfumes. This means that the bottle contains between 19% and 21% perfume oil. Designer Eau de Toilette bottles contain between 10% and 15% perfume oil.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
